<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Italian basket.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Italian basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued one million American-style warrants, on an Italian Insurance basket, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International said.</p>
<p>The basket has a 30 percent weighting of Generali, a 20 percent weighting of Ina, a 20 percent weighting of Ras, a 20 percent weighting of Alleanza and a 10 percent weighting of LaFondiaria.</p>
<p>One basket is controlled by one warrant.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    115,000 ITL	     PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9270 ITL		  GEARING	10.78 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	15.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  100,000 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
